    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "呀吼～我是泽渡可可哦～！<br>\n你们能看到我吗～？", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "喂，你在做什么啊……？", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Hanna001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Angry1", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "别随便进来啊！<br>\n我现在正在直播呢！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "直播……？还有这种功能吗？", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Hanna002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Smile1,ArmR4,ArmL2", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "欸～，嗯～，哦～～", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "原～来如此啊～！这也太过分啦！<br>\n嗯嗯，有幕后黑手，我会变成怪物……<br>\n太糟糕了！！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你在和谁说话啊……？", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Hanna003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 52, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL3", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哈？和自己啊。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 56, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "和自己说话？你是在自言自语吗？<br>\n你该不会是个疯子吧？", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Hanna004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 58, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL2", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 60, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "都说了别进来啊大小姐！<br>\n现在正到重要的地方呢！", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我只要在直播中露脸，<br>\n就能和那边的我自己连接在一起。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，这好像是只有在我魔女化进行到一定程度<br>\n才能使用的能力。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "现在的我只能从那边的我那里<br>\n获得有限的信息。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "？？？", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Hanna005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Coco.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL2", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……虽然只能知道到我死为止的事，<br>\n不过我大概已经明白啦。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "真是不可原谅啊。我居然会死。<br>\n在见到我推之前，我可不能死啊。", "AuthorId": "Coco", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv05_Coco011"]}},
